{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "nonce泄密",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 130.32,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "第二处随机性，在签名里。",
   "spoken": "第二处随机性，在签名里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.154
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "ECDSA 每次签名，都需要一个一次性的数，叫 k，也就是 nonce。",
   "spoken": "ECDSA 每次签名，都需要一个一次性的数，叫 k，也就是 nonce。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 4.719,
   "speechEnd": 10.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "k 出错有三种情况。第一种，两次签名用了同一个 k。",
   "spoken": "k 出错有三种情况。第一种，两次签名用了同一个 k。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 10.92,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 11.015,
   "speechEnd": 15.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "攻击者还需要别的东西吗？",
   "spoken": "攻击者还需要别的东西吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 15.78,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 15.78,
   "speechEnd": 17.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "不需要。两个签名和两个消息哈希都是公开的，直接解方程，就得到私钥。",
   "spoken": "不需要。两个签名和两个消息哈希都是公开的，直接解方程，就得到私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 18.28,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 18.382,
   "speechEnd": 24.36
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "打个比方。nonce 像一块每次都换的遮布，盖在私钥上面。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。nonce 像一块每次都换的遮布，盖在私钥上面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 24.82,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 24.916,
   "speechEnd": 29.896
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "同一块布用了两次，两次结果一对比，布就被消掉，私钥就显出来了。",
   "spoken": "同一块布用了两次，两次结果一对比，布就被消掉，私钥就显出来了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 30.32,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 30.416,
   "speechEnd": 36.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "比方的局限是，真实过程是解方程。而且下面两种情况，一次对比无法解决。",
   "spoken": "比方的局限是，真实过程是解方程。而且下面两种情况，一次对比无法解决。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 36.78,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 36.888,
   "speechEnd": 43.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第二种，k 有偏置，比如高几位总是 0。收集足够多签名，用格方法就能恢复私钥。",
   "spoken": "第二种，k 有偏置，比如高几位总是 0。收集足够多签名，用格方法就能恢复私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 44.44,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 44.44,
   "speechEnd": 52.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第三种最糟。k 可以由公开数据算出，那么单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "spoken": "第三种最糟。k 可以由公开数据算出，那么单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 52.9,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 52.9,
   "speechEnd": 59.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "标准早有解法，叫 RFC 6979。它用私钥和消息，确定性地派生 k，可以消除前两种风险。",
   "spoken": "标准早有解法，叫 RFC 六九七九。它用私钥和消息，确定性的派生 k，可以消除前两种风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 59.6,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 59.695,
   "speechEnd": 68.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "EdDSA 标准也要求，nonce 由私钥的秘密部分派生。风险来自偏离标准的实现。",
   "spoken": "EdDSA 标准也要求，nonce 由私钥的秘密部分派生。风险来自偏离标准的实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 68.7,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 68.8,
   "speechEnd": 75.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "三个案例。2013 年 8 月，Android 的随机数缺陷，让不同签名用了相同的 nonce，多款比特币钱包受影响。",
   "spoken": "三个案例。2013 年 8 月，Android 的随机数缺陷，让不同签名用了相同的 nonce，多款比特币钱包受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 76.12,
   "dur": 9.2,
   "speechStart": 76.12,
   "speechEnd": 85.146
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "2019 年，一项研究用格方法，恢复出数百个比特币私钥，和数十个以太坊私钥。",
   "spoken": "2019 年，一项研究用格方法，恢复出数百个比特币私钥，和数十个以太坊私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 85.54,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 85.644,
   "speechEnd": 93.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "2026 年 6 月，Cardano 钱包 SecondFi 的 Android 版，用公开交易数据派生 nonce，漏掉了秘密部分。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 6 月，Cardano 钱包 SecondFi 的 Android 版，用公开交易数据派生 nonce，漏掉了秘密部分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 93.84,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 93.947,
   "speechEnd": 102.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "nonce 人人可算，单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "spoken": "nonce 人人可算，单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 102.7,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 102.802,
   "speechEnd": 106.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "374 个钱包被盗，约 1600 万 ADA，约 240 万美元。这是官方口径，SlowMist 的估计更高。",
   "spoken": "374 个钱包被盗，约 1600 万 ADA，约 240 万美元。这是官方口径，SlowMist 的估计更高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 107.0,
   "dur": 9.28,
   "speechStart": 107.0,
   "speechEnd": 116.077
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "硬件钱包签名走另一条路径，不受影响。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包签名走另一条路径，不受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 116.5,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 116.5,
   "speechEnd": 119.545
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "教训是，nonce 必须确定性派生，并包含私钥的秘密材料。封装层要做已知答案测试，不能只信任底层库。",
   "spoken": "教训是，nonce 必须确定性派生，并包含私钥的秘密材料。封装层要做已知答案测试，不能只信任底层库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 120.0,
   "dur": 9.12,
   "speechStart": 120.09,
   "speechEnd": 128.954
  }
